title: 'statement-store: add a flag that turns the v2 DHT path on'
doc:
- audience: [Node Operator, Node Dev]
  description: |-
    The new `--statement-v2-dht` flag on the substrate node and the omni-node makes a node with
    the statement store route statements through the DHT instead of flooding them to every peer.
    Without it the node floods as before. The `STATEMENT_STORE_V2_DHT_ENABLED` environment
    variable is gone. Node binaries set the gate once from the CLI with `set_v2dht_enabled`.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
- name: staging-node-cli
  bump: minor
